    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴλημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>veil, covering, wrapper</i>, [<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>] ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.28.18a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλεός</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Flat.</u>
				9
			</span></i> (pl., dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a coil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοινίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.187
				</span></i>
			; <i>roll</i> of a bandage, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).809
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Archit.,
				<i>arch</i> spanning intercolumniation, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Anz.</u>
				19.8
			</span></i> (Milet.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2782.31
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>vault, cellar</i>, prob. in <i>PLond.ined.</i><i><span class="en">
				1821.387
			</span></i>.</div>
